  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>More adept than your everyday undead, your necrotic soldiers are trained to fight.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> ability to create undead creatures</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> For every 4 racial HD all undead creatures you create possess, it gains a +1 bonus to attack rolls. In addition, every undead creature you create gains one combat feat as a bonus feat, chosen at the time of its creation. It must meet the prerequisites for the feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
